Package: ageless-device
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-serial, udev, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: picotool, micropython-mpremote, udisks2
Suggests: thonny, ageless-maker
Description: Ageless Linux support for the Ageless Device (RP2040/RP2350)
 Connects Ageless Linux to the Ageless Device, a Raspberry Pi RP2040 or
 RP2350 handheld with an OLED and a keyboard, and to other RP2040/RP2350
 boards:
  * udev rules giving the logged-in user access to the boards in every mode
    (BOOTSEL, MicroPython, Pico SDK serial, Debug Probe), with stable
    /dev/ageless/* names for their serial ports;
  * the ageless-device command: list connected boards, flash UF2 firmware,
    and copy files to and from MicroPython boards.
 Wi-Fi sync and the Ageless Store are planned (see docs/ageless-device.md).
